ng training) and has NEVER seen a t0-window crop -- the ONLY geometry this live pipeline can ever produce at forecast time (the future perimeter is, by definition, unknown). So every live prediction from this model is out-of-distribution relative to its own training. The measured t0-window numbers above already reflect that (they are not a surprise), but this is 'best available', not 'production-ready' -- represent it that way. The operating_point (floor=0.0, mult=0.9) is the VAL-selected connected-causal decode point; it did NOT clear the 0.50 precision floor during selection (feasible=False, val P=0.270/R=0.259) -- it's the best-F1 fallback point, not a precision-guaranteed one.","issued_at_utc":"2026-09-01 02:36:03.981437+00:00","valid_from_utc":"2026-09-01 00:00:00","valid_to_utc":"2026-09-02 00:00:00","wfigs_date_current_utc":"2026-09-01 01:51:15+00:00","pixel_size_m":30,"veg_source":"refreshed_d4","physics_source":"eikonal_fbfm40","history_n_dates":22,"degraded_history":false,"containment_pct":73,"acres_wfigs":22714.821120762244,"observed_acres_raster":22973.83,"predicted_growth_acres":1143.11,"predicted_growth_pct":4.9757,"predicted_growth_max_reach_px":2.24,"predicted_growth_max_reach_m":67.1,"perimeter_clipped":false,"hour":9,"valid_at_utc":"2026-09-01 09:00:00"}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-121.00569,48.9684],[-121.00528,48.9684],[-121.00528,48.96813],[-121.00569,48.96813],[-121.00569,48.9684]]],[[[-121.00569,48.96732],[-121.0061,48.96732],[-121.0061,48.96679],[-121.00651,48.96679],[-121.00651,48.96598],[-121.00692,48.96598],[-121.00692,48.96544],[-121.00733,48.96544],[-121.00733,48.9649],[-121.00774,48.9649],[-121.00774,48.96409],[-121.00733,48.96409],[-121.00733,48.96382],[-121.00651,48.96382],[-121.00651,48.96355],[-121.0061,48.96355],[-121.0061,48.96328],[-121.00569,48.96328],[-121.00569,48.96301],[-121.00486,48.96274],[-121.00486,48.96247],[-121.00404,48.9622],[-121.00404,48.96193],[-121.00322,48.96167],[-121